###Mapping
Mapping test::nobleorchard7::mapping::TreeMapping
(
  *test::nobleorchard7::domain::Tree[tree]: Relational
  {
    ~primaryKey
    (
      [test::nobleorchard7::store::OrchardDb]ORCHARD.TREE.TREE_ID
    )
    ~mainTable [test::nobleorchard7::store::OrchardDb]ORCHARD.TREE
    treeCode: [test::nobleorchard7::store::OrchardDb]ORCHARD.TREE.TREE_CODE,
    cultivar: [test::nobleorchard7::store::OrchardDb]ORCHARD.TREE.CULTIVAR
  }
)
